 were vastly superior.",
            "A domain is not judged only by raw cursed energy. Barrier construction, refinement, sure-hit compatibility, and the conditions imposed on the barrier all influence a clash."
          ]
        },
        {
          title: "Common misconceptions",
          bullets: [
            "Unlimited Void does not literally teach the target all knowledge in a useful form.",
            "The target is immobilized because their cognition is overloaded, not because gravity or telekinesis pins them down.",
            "The 0.2-second feat does not mean every person can safely endure exactly that amount under every circumstance.",
            "Infinity, the defensive neutral application of Limitless, is separate from Unlimited Void's sure-hit."
          ]
        },
        {
          title: "Later manga developments",
          spoiler: "manga",
          paragraphs: [
            "The battle between Gojo and Sukuna shows much more advanced manipulation of Unlimited Void's barrier conditions, including changes to the barrier's size and the strength of its inner and outer surfaces. These sequences demonstrate that even an established Domain Expansion can be reconfigured by an elite barrier user during repeated clashes."
          ]
        }
